v0 ORIGINAL(raw-html): <a href='javascript:...'>CLICKME</a>            (LIVE)
v0 RESIDUAL(markdown): <a href="javascript:...">CLICKME</a>            (LIVE)
v1 ORIGINAL(raw-html): CLICKME                                        (href/anchor STRIPPED by sanitizeATag)
v1 RESIDUAL(markdown): <a href="javascript:...">CLICKME</a>           (LIVE — core inlineLink bypass)
v2 ORIGINAL(raw-html): CLICKME                                        (stripped)
v2 RESIDUAL(markdown): <a href="">CLICKME</a>                         (BLANKED by inlineLink override)

